  sentences:
  - name: Stranger
    text: "I didn\u2019t know her. I want to be clear about that. I came because
      I didn\u2019t want her to disappear into headlines. I learned her name the
      same way I learned the others\u2019. From a list. That didn\u2019t feel right."
